Bind Npc 32614 Zone 71

On greeting
    If quest 191 is started and player has 900076000 and player has effect 490119 and player is karus
        Say "[We haven't found anything]"
        Topic "Open" do
            Transaction
                Take 1 of 900076000
                Give 1 of 900038000
            Say "[You have succeeded in seizing the document from the Classified Documents Box]"
    Else if quest 191 is started and player is karus
        Say "[You can't open the classified document box]"
    Else
        Say "[The classified documents box of our force is well kept right now]"
